\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Reduced nonlinear/proxy scenario sweeps from 0 to 1\,A in 0.05\,A increments. Missing intervals are numerical rejections, not interpolated operating data. Curves do not represent three-dimensional cavity solutions, measured performance or qualified continuous optima.}}{23}{figure.18}\protected@file@percent }
